{{also|V-sign}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|V-sign}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{C|en|Peace}} A sign of [[victory]] or [[peace]] made by raising the [[index]] and [[middle]] [[finger]]s with the [[palm]] [[outward]]s.
# {{lb|en|chiefly|UK|Irish|Commonwealth}} A [[gesture]] of [[contempt]] or insult made by raising the index and middle fingers with the palm [[inward]]s; [[apocryphally]] originated by [[English]] [[bowmen]] at [[:w:V_sign#Origins|Agincourt]] (in actuality attested only from 1901).

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|victory or peace}} {{l|en|peace sign}}
* {{sense|contempt}} {{l|en|Harvey Smith sign}}, {{l|en|Harvey Smith salute}}

